{"sections":[{"slug":"Möbius反演","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Möbius反演"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">反演</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Möbius 反演"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">反演说的是对于数论函数</span> $f,g\\colon \\mathbb{N}_+ \\to\\mathbb{C}$,\n<span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $f = g * 1$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $g = f * \\mu$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mu$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Möbius函数","text":"Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">运算</span> $*$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Dirichlet卷积","text":"Dirichlet <span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">推广</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">范畴上的</span> Möbius <span lang=\"zh\">反演</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}